[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0010","text":"（好了，看看真乃和灯织的情况吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0020","text":"（……嗯？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0030","text":"（灯织在挑战的是……游戏吗？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_9999","text":"贴纸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_9998","text":"游戏画面"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0040","text":"任务！\n在电脑部自制的格斗游戏中打出最高分！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0050","text":"（完成这个任务的奖励\n　说不定可以用来夺回巡……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0060","text":"（一定要通关……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0070","text":"（加油啊，灯织！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0080","text":"『YOU LOSE！！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0090","text":"再一次……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0100","text":"（啊——，差一点！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0110","text":"（但是，反复挑战的话\n　巡会注意到的……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0120","text":"（别失去冷静啊，灯织……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0130","text":"不放弃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_9997","text":"校内广播"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0140","text":"“学园祭将在10分钟后结束”\n“各位来宾，请尽快前往校门”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02020000_03_0150","text":"…………加油啊，大家……"}]
